UID:zindi-bias-bounty-mapping-equity-challenge-2026@artificialnouveau.githu
 b.io
DTSTAMP:20261025T090229Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Deadline: Zindi: Bias Bounty Mapping Equity Challenge
DESCRIPTION:A bias bounty from Zindi\, Humane Intelligence\, Radiant Earth\
 , and the Heising-Simons Foundation: measure coverage gaps in Overture Map
 s across US Census tracts by comparing it against Census TIGER/Line Roads\
 , Microsoft US Building Footprints\, USGS National Map critical facilities
 \, and Census County Business Patterns. Submissions are automatically eval
 uated with a Bias Score assessing equity metrics across demographic and cl
 imate-vulnerability strata\, surfacing whose neighbourhoods open map data 
 underserves. PRIZES: 1st USD 4\,500\, 2nd USD 2\,500\, 3rd USD 1\,500\, Be
 st Bias Discovery USD 1\,000\, Best Documentation USD 500 (USD 10\,000 tot
 al)\, plus 10\,000 Zindi points. ELIGIBILITY: open to all\, teams of up to
  4. HOW TO ENTER: create a Zindi account\, download the sample submission 
 files\, compute coverage-gap scores per tract GEOID\, and upload a CSV\; 1
 0 submissions per day\, 300 total. Free to enter. DEADLINE: 31 October 202
 6.\n\nOrganisation: Zindi with Humane Intelligence\, Radiant Earth\, and t
 he Heising-Simons Foundation\nLocation: Online\, open to all worldwide\; t
 eams of up to 4.\nAward: USD 10\,000 total in prizes: 1st USD 4\,500\, 2nd
  USD 2\,500\, 3rd USD 1\,500\, Best Bias Discovery USD 1\,000\, Best Docum
 entation USD 500\, plus 10\,000 Zindi points. Free to enter.\nDuration: Ru
 ns 28 August to 31 October 2026\; up to 10 submissions per day\, 300 total
 .\n\nMore: https://zindi.world/competitions/bias-bounty-mapping-equity-cha
 llenge?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://zindi.world/competitions/bias-bounty-mapping-equity-challenge?u
 tm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Online\, open to all worldwide\; teams of up to 4.
END:VEVENT
