SUMMARY:Deadline: Creative Europe MEDIA: Innovative Tools and Business Mode
 ls 2027 (EUR 14 million call\, AI\, data and virtual worlds for audiovisua
 l)
DESCRIPTION:The MEDIA strand's Innovative Tools and Business Models call (C
 REA-MEDIA-2027-INNOVBUSMOD) funds tools and business models that strengthe
 n the competitiveness of the European audiovisual and video games industri
 es. WHAT IT FUNDS: tools for subtitling\, accessibility\, discoverability 
 and recommendation\; automated rights management and data analytics\; busi
 ness models linking festivals\, cinemas and VOD\; new modes of production\
 , financing or distribution using AI\, big data\, blockchain\, virtual wor
 lds or NFTs\; and greening the audiovisual and video games industry. WHO: 
 a single organisation or a consortium of two or more\, established in a ME
 DIA country\; individuals cannot apply. WHAT YOU GET: grants at an 80 perc
 ent funding rate from a total budget of EUR 14\,000\,000. APPLICATION: via
  the EU Funding and Tenders portal. DEADLINE: 14 January 2027\, 17:00 CET 
 (Brussels).\n\nOrganisation: Creative Europe MEDIA (European Commission / 
 EACEA)\nLocation: EU Member States\, EEA and countries associated to Creat
 ive Europe MEDIA. For organisations (legal entities) established in a MEDI
 A country\; natural persons cannot apply.\nAward: Total call budget EUR 14
 \,000\,000\; no fixed cap per project\; 80 percent funding rate. No applic
 ation fee.\nDuration: Projects normally up to 36 months. Call opened 30 Se
 ptember 2026.\n\nMore: https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportuni
 ties/portal/screen/opportunities/topic-details/CREA-MEDIA-2027-INNOVBUSMOD
 ?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/o
 pportunities/topic-details/CREA-MEDIA-2027-INNOVBUSMOD?utm_source=artifici
 alnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:EU Member States\, EEA and countries associated to Creative Europe
  MEDIA. For organisations (legal entities) established in a MEDIA country\
 ; natural persons cannot apply.
