 eaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:EU Member States\, EEA and countries associated to Creative Europe
  MEDIA. For organisations (legal entities) established in a MEDIA country\
 ; natural persons cannot apply. Consortia of at least two independent prod
 uction companies from two MEDIA countries.
